1
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:49,439
Three days.

2
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:50,760
Three days at most.

3
00:01:50,760 --> 00:01:51,840
When the time comes, principal and interest,

4
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,319
I'll pay it all back to you.

5
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:55,079
If anything happens, it's on me.

6
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:56,280
Demanding a refund now?

7
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:56,799
We can't refund it.

8
00:02:00,799 --> 00:02:01,519
There's no money.

9
00:02:02,319 --> 00:02:03,280
How are we supposed to close the books?

10
00:02:04,879 --> 00:02:05,480
We can't wait any longer.

11
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:07,959
Close the books first.

12
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:09,599
As for this money,

13
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:11,879
just say it was loaned out.

14
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:14,879
You,

15
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:16,840
pack up and head to Changfu right now.

16
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,960
Sort out the previous accounts.

17
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:18,560
Any later,

18
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,840
and our construction team is done for.

19
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:20,560
Right, right.

20
00:02:27,159 --> 00:02:27,719
I'm begging you.

21
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:29,879
Dad will be discharged soon.

22
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:31,800
Two days.

23
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:32,800
Just two days.

24
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:33,960
Get that money back to me.

25
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:37,120
I'm off.

26
00:02:45,639 --> 00:02:46,000
Brother-in-law,

27
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,199
with this contract,

28
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,879
anyone auditing it will immediately spot

29
00:02:48,879 --> 00:02:50,360
glaring oversights in our work.

30
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,080
Tengyue will definitely hold us accountable.

31
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:53,719
Second Brother!

32
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,639
Second Brother!

33
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:57,599
It's my big brother.

34
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:58,680
Second Brother!

35
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:01,879
Xiao Meng!

36
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:03,599
Open the door!

37
00:03:07,639 --> 00:03:08,319
Big Brother, what's all this?

38
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:09,199
Where's my brother?

39
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,080
Inside.

40
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:11,759
Let me carry that for you.

41
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:12,840
No, no need. Open the door.

42
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,520
Wait, why are you here?

43
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:19,759
I brought the materials over.

44
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:23,439
Qingyou pulled

45
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:26,240
several all-nighters at Changfu

46
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:27,800
to sort out these accounts.

47
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:28,800
Go through them right away.

48
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:29,240
Wait, are you...

49
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,080
Are you guys really doing this?

50
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:31,960
What else can we do?

51
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,120
There's quite a lot here.

52
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:34,280
Hurry up. I'm off.

53
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:34,840
Wait a minute.

54
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:36,919
Let's step outside first.

55
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:37,719
Wait, these accounts...

56
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,560
Step outside first.

57
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:46,639
What is it?

58
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:48,599
Do you even realize

59
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:49,479
what you're doing?

60
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:50,360
Do you even realize

61
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,639
what you're asking me to do?

62
00:03:51,639 --> 00:03:52,319
All I know is

63
00:03:52,319 --> 00:03:53,360
this is our family's business.

64
00:03:53,439 --> 00:03:54,240
Are you going to help or not?

65
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,319
I'm a lawyer!

66
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,280
If things blow up, what happens to me?

67
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:56,599
Second Brother...

68
00:03:56,599 --> 00:03:57,360
Have any of you ever considered me?

69
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:57,599
Second Brother...

70
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,479
You only think about yourselves!

71
00:03:58,479 --> 00:03:58,919
Second Brother...

72
00:03:58,919 --> 00:04:00,000
Did you ever consider me?!

73
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,240
I know you're a lawyer,

74
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:02,639
but you're also a son of the Sai family!

75
00:04:02,919 --> 00:04:03,639
The money for your college,

76
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:04,599
the money for your wedding,

77
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,800
wasn't it scraped together

78
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,560
penny by penny for you? You...

79
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,599
Do you really think you can wash your hands of this?

80
00:04:14,159 --> 00:04:14,479
Enough.

81
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,639
I've brought the materials over.

82
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,519
Do it or don't.

83
00:04:17,519 --> 00:04:18,720
Make up your own mind.

84
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:34,279
You know the consequences

85
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:34,879
of doing this.

86
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:35,879
Are you sure you want to do this?

87
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,279
Think this through carefully.

88
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,360
As a son,

89
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,079
Sai Xiuliang knows

90
00:04:58,079 --> 00:05:00,959
half his father's life's work is in this.

91
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:03,680
But as a lawyer,

92
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:07,639
he has principles he must uphold

93
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:08,800
and a bottom line.

94
00:05:09,959 --> 00:05:11,680
Now he's truly in a bind.

95
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:50,720
Why didn't you answer the phone?

96
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:04,319
Qianjin, it's all here.

97
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:06,160
Great, I'll head back over there.

98
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:07,199
Wait.

99
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,160
Load them onto the truck first.

100
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:09,800
All right.

101
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:13,720
Look at this.

102
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,600
It's only been a few days,

103
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,920
and I pulled three all-nighters to redesign it.

104
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,680
Some details still need work.

105
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,040
It looks gorgeous.

106
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:24,199
I had Xiuli find them online,

107
00:06:24,399 --> 00:06:25,680
the latest styles from abroad.

108
00:06:25,759 --> 00:06:26,920
I borrowed a few details.

109
00:06:27,079 --> 00:06:28,759
This'll blow Dennis away.

110
00:06:29,319 --> 00:06:30,600
The fabric might be a bit cheap,

111
00:06:30,959 --> 00:06:31,720
but the craftsmanship...

112
00:06:31,879 --> 00:06:32,759
I'm totally confident in it.

113
00:06:32,959 --> 00:06:34,759
From a distance, who could tell?

114
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:35,720
Exactly.

115
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,279
Our price is lower than Brother Peng's,

116
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,720
and our style is newer.

117
00:06:39,879 --> 00:06:40,680
We definitely have a shot.

118
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:42,720
When you're at work,

119
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,000
don't let anything slip.

120
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:45,040
I know what I'm doing.

121
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:47,519
Come on, let's go.

122
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,399
Your phone's ringing.

123
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:49,879
Hold on.

124
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:50,519
Hand it to me.

125
00:06:50,519 --> 00:06:51,199
Answer your phone. Go ahead.

126
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:51,720
Careful now.

127
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:56,680
Hello?

128
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:58,279
Qianjin.

129
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,800
Are you at work?

130
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,319
I want to see you.

131
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,079
I don't have time.

132
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,439
I just want to talk.

133
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,319
Ma Laijiao,

134
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:11,000
what's wrong with you?

135
00:07:11,399 --> 00:07:12,920
Are you even in your right mind?

136
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:16,519
Big Brother has a family.

137
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,079
Your affair was shameful to begin with,

138
00:07:19,079 --> 00:07:20,399
and now Second Brother caught you.

139
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:22,079
Do... do you really think

140
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,279
anything good will come of this?

141
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,600
Let me tell you,

142
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,720
Big Brother goes straight home on time every day.

143
00:07:27,959 --> 00:07:29,439
He won't take your calls or answer your texts.

144
00:07:29,439 --> 00:07:30,560
Isn't his message

145
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:33,000
clear enough to you?

146
00:07:45,439 --> 00:07:46,560
Let me ask you something.

147
00:07:47,079 --> 00:07:49,000
Do you think what you two have

148
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:50,240
is actually love?

149
00:07:54,519 --> 00:07:56,399
You've got way too much time on your hands, really.

150
00:07:58,439 --> 00:07:59,439
Ever since my sister-in-law and I

151
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,079
opened this bridal shop,

152
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:02,639
every day, I'm so exhausted

153
00:08:02,639 --> 00:08:03,800
I crash the minute I lie down.

154
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,120
How would I have the headspace for

155
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,560
all this pointless nonsense?

156
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,360
Honestly, give me a break.

157
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:10,160
As long as you're okay.

158
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:23,480
Today is the prep meeting for acquiring Changfu Construction.

159
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,600
Attorney Sai, please brief us

160
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,720
on the contract review.

161
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:28,519
After a thorough review,

162
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:29,240
the agreements between Changfu Construction

163
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:32,360
and Duoxi Construction Services

164
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,879
bear valid signatures and seals from both parties.

165
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:36,120
Key terms such as

166
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:38,360
scope of work, pricing methods,

167
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:39,480
and payment milestones

168
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,840
are all clear and explicit.

169
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:44,159
No material flaws in rights and liabilities were found.

170
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:45,480
Existing records show that

171
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,720
past cooperation between both parties,

172
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,799
in terms of contracts and execution,

173
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:51,360
reveals no major non-compliance or violations.

174
00:08:51,559 --> 00:08:53,240
The detailed review process and legal basis

175
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:54,080
have already been

176
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:55,960
set out in the body of the report

177
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,320
and its appendices.

178
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,320
The figures inside

179
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:01,679
all check out.

180
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:04,360
Project timelines,

181
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:05,639
staffing,

182
00:09:06,039 --> 00:09:06,559
and amounts

183
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,720
have all undergone careful review,

184
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,559
and were cross-referenced

185
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:11,480
with our other projects.

186
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:12,320
There are no issues.

187
00:09:12,759 --> 00:09:13,559
What about the accounts?

188
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:14,360
Mr. Shi,

189
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,759
all the accounting data

190
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:17,799
and vouchers

191
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:18,679
have been verified.

192
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:21,480
There are typical operational flaws common to the industry,

193
00:09:21,639 --> 00:09:23,519
but we found no fundamental issues.

194
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:26,919
Over all these years,

195
00:09:27,519 --> 00:09:28,480
across all past contracts

196
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:30,799
and related accounts,

197
00:09:31,039 --> 00:09:32,000
not a single problem?

198
00:09:33,519 --> 00:09:34,200
Mr. Shi,

199
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:37,159
Attorney Sai handled the legal review,

200
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,519
and finance is your own team.

201
00:09:39,639 --> 00:09:40,360
Don't tell me

202
00:09:40,559 --> 00:09:41,960
you don't even trust your own people.

203
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,559
Mr. Wei,

204
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:43,879
both you and I

205
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,600
worked in construction.

206
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,759
I just don't believe

207
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:47,879
it could be this clean.

208
00:09:54,159 --> 00:09:55,399
The same grade of cement,

209
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,600
the same brand,

210
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,600
the same supplier.

211
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,159
Why is this year's price

212
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,279
15% higher than last year's?

213
00:10:02,639 --> 00:10:04,120
Let me explain that.

214
00:10:04,399 --> 00:10:05,840
This year in Honggang,

215
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,200
so many projects broke ground.

216
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,519
To keep up with the schedule,

217
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:09,679
we had to buy even at higher prices,

218
00:10:09,679 --> 00:10:10,879
or work would have stopped.

219
00:10:10,879 --> 00:10:11,720
Then why didn't you

220
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,480
negotiate the price

221
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,000
with the supplier beforehand?

222
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,399
We did. We agreed beforehand.

223
00:10:17,559 --> 00:10:19,000
The problem was our site had

224
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,879
frequent shutdowns, constant inspections,

225
00:10:21,039 --> 00:10:22,200
and delayed payouts. So...

226
00:10:22,679 --> 00:10:23,759
well, the supplier

227
00:10:23,879 --> 00:10:25,159
got cold feet, you know?

228
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:27,000
This month's travel expenses were 20,000.

229
00:10:27,399 --> 00:10:28,519
The workers stay on-site.

230
00:10:28,759 --> 00:10:30,000
Why are travel expenses so high?

231
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:32,759
Are these accounts padded or faked?

232
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:33,840
Speak up!

233
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:40,759
I... That's what our...

234
00:10:40,759 --> 00:10:42,480
our ac-accountant logged.

235
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,360
I really don't know!

236
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:44,320
If you don't know, who does?

237
00:10:44,639 --> 00:10:45,919
You're the site supervisor!

238
00:10:47,279 --> 00:10:48,960
Well, maybe there were some...

239
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:50,559
other expenses.

240
00:10:50,559 --> 00:10:51,399
What expenses?

241
00:10:58,519 --> 00:10:59,440
It's... it's just...

242
00:11:00,039 --> 00:11:01,799
there's a chance...

243
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:03,480
Mr. Shi,

244
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:04,720
there are some routine meals

245
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:06,639
where there's just no way

246
00:11:07,679 --> 00:11:09,919
to get an invoice...

247
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:11,080
Did I say you could speak?

248
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:16,759
Mr. Shi,

249
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,080
it's only 20,000 yuan.

250
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:21,759
No need to make such a big deal out of it.

251
00:11:21,759 --> 00:11:24,240
I'm not making a big deal over 20,000 yuan.

252
00:11:24,799 --> 00:11:25,679
You spent money,

253
00:11:26,159 --> 00:11:26,960
so you have to account for it.

254
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,840
How am I supposed to know where the money went?

255
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,120
Was it embezzled,

256
00:11:30,559 --> 00:11:31,240
used for bribes,

257
00:11:31,879 --> 00:11:33,840
or lined someone's pockets?

258
00:11:34,679 --> 00:11:35,799
Well, if you don't believe it,

259
00:11:35,799 --> 00:11:37,840
you can bring in people to check again.

260
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,320
Don't worry.

261
00:11:39,039 --> 00:11:39,879
I definitely will.

262
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:42,320
I'll bring more people over from headquarters,

263
00:11:42,799 --> 00:11:44,080
and go through all these records

264
00:11:44,519 --> 00:11:45,360
with a fine-tooth comb.

265
00:11:45,799 --> 00:11:46,320
At the same time,

266
00:11:46,919 --> 00:11:47,960
we'll also investigate

267
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:50,000
the audit of Changfu,

268
00:11:50,559 --> 00:11:51,720
to see if any personnel involved

269
00:11:51,799 --> 00:11:52,960
committed any violations.

270
00:11:53,559 --> 00:11:54,879
Let me remind everyone:

271
00:11:55,399 --> 00:11:57,399
if there are just minor accounting flaws,

272
00:11:58,519 --> 00:12:00,799
it'll only affect our final acquisition price at most.

273
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:03,639
But if I find anyone committing fraud,

274
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:05,600
that's an entirely different story.

275
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,840
Every single one of you in this room—

276
00:12:08,360 --> 00:12:08,840
not one of you

277
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,559
will get off the hook.

278
00:12:15,480 --> 00:12:15,960
Mr. Shi,

279
00:12:16,519 --> 00:12:17,960
if up to this point

280
00:12:18,679 --> 00:12:20,000
you haven't found any issues,

281
00:12:20,279 --> 00:12:21,919
could you release the Phase 3 payment

282
00:12:22,279 --> 00:12:23,080
for our site first?

283
00:12:23,559 --> 00:12:24,799
Until the audit is finished,

284
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:27,120
not a single cent will be released.

285
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,639
But you haven't found anything wrong so far, have you?

286
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:32,799
Mr. Shi.

287
00:12:33,799 --> 00:12:34,519
Something important has come up.

288
00:12:37,879 --> 00:12:38,399
What is it?

289
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:40,679
Headquarters called.

290
00:12:41,159 --> 00:12:42,600
They think the third payment isn't large,

291
00:12:42,759 --> 00:12:43,679
and asked you to disburse it promptly.

292
00:12:43,759 --> 00:12:45,000
It concerns the group's reputation.

293
00:12:45,639 --> 00:12:46,639
Also, you need to head back to headquarters.

294
00:12:46,720 --> 00:12:47,840
I've already booked your flight.

295
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:49,480
Why?

296
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:52,080
Take a look at this.

297
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,039
A formal complaint was filed against you.

298
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:56,200
Headquarters wants you to check

299
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,679
if the allegations in the letter are true.

300
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:14,840
Look at this.

301
00:13:16,799 --> 00:13:17,759
See for yourself.

302
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:30,799
Dear Leaders of Tengyue Real Estate,

303
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:32,039
Greetings:

304
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:34,960
I am from Honggang City, Qidong Province,

305
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:37,200
the contractor of Duoxi Construction Team,

306
00:13:37,919 --> 00:13:38,840
Sai Duoxi.

307
00:13:39,159 --> 00:13:41,120
Together with the head of another team,

308
00:13:41,519 --> 00:13:42,440
Ma Jiucheng,

309
00:13:42,799 --> 00:13:43,799
I have long partnered

310
00:13:44,039 --> 00:13:45,240
to jointly undertake projects

311
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:48,080
for Changfu Construction.

312
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,000
In July 2006,

313
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,080
Changfu Construction won the contract for

314
00:13:52,279 --> 00:13:55,879
your project in Shuncheng District, Honggang:

315
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:59,879
Peninsula New Town Phase I on Xianghai Road.

316
00:14:00,159 --> 00:14:02,039
Our two teams were assigned to build

317
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:05,440
Buildings 6 through 12.

318
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,519
Last month, these buildings

319
00:14:07,799 --> 00:14:10,039
completed their main structural topping-out.

320
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,840
Under the terms of the contract,

321
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:14,720
your company was required at this stage

322
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:16,559
to pay Changfu Construction

323
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:19,159
the third installment of project funds.

324
00:14:19,759 --> 00:14:20,240
However,

325
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:23,240
your General Manager, Shi Yongnian,

326
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,080
has fabricated endless excuses

327
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:27,240
to stall payments repeatedly.

328
00:14:27,679 --> 00:14:30,759
We complied with every request

329
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:34,120
and fully overhauled the construction site,

330
00:14:34,879 --> 00:14:37,720
yet Mr. Shi still refuses to approve payment.

331
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:42,000
Instead, he keeps making unreasonable demands

332
00:14:42,759 --> 00:14:43,759
to deliberately make things difficult.

333
00:14:45,879 --> 00:14:46,799
18 years ago,

334
00:14:47,399 --> 00:14:49,200
I, Ma Jiucheng,

335
00:14:49,600 --> 00:14:52,080
Wei Changfu, and Shi Yongnian

336
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:54,639
all worked together as laborers in Honggang.

337
00:14:55,519 --> 00:14:57,440
During a construction project,

338
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,799
Shi Yongnian's younger brother

339
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,799
tragically lost his life in an accident.

340
00:15:03,919 --> 00:15:04,440
In the aftermath,

341
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:06,320
he blamed his brother's death

342
00:15:06,519 --> 00:15:08,200
entirely on the three of us.

343
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,840
Understanding his devastating grief,

344
00:15:11,399 --> 00:15:12,480
we chose not to argue

345
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:15,279
and gave all the compensation funds

346
00:15:15,759 --> 00:15:17,960
to him to handle as he saw fit.

347
00:15:19,039 --> 00:15:19,559
After that,

348
00:15:20,120 --> 00:15:21,919
Shi Yongnian left Honggang

349
00:15:22,519 --> 00:15:24,159
and cut all ties with us.

350
00:15:25,559 --> 00:15:26,080
Now that

351
00:15:26,799 --> 00:15:30,600
he has returned as your General Manager,

352
00:15:31,399 --> 00:15:32,440
he has begun

353
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:36,120
deliberately targeting Changfu Construction

354
00:15:36,559 --> 00:15:38,679
as well as our two construction teams.

355
00:15:39,519 --> 00:15:42,039
He not only delays payments without cause,

356
00:15:42,519 --> 00:15:45,759
but also conducts constant, baseless inspections.

357
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:47,559
Ma Jiucheng and I

358
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:51,600
have worked in Honggang's construction for 20 years.

359
00:15:52,519 --> 00:15:54,480
We have always held quality paramount,

360
00:15:55,399 --> 00:15:57,519
and our record has been spotless.

361
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:00,159
Yet ever since Shi Yongnian took office,

362
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:02,320
we have faced obstruction at every turn,

363
00:16:03,279 --> 00:16:04,840
making normal work impossible.

364
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:08,679
With payments held up,

365
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:11,000
the site is on the verge of shutting down.

366
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:14,519
We urge management to take this seriously,

367
00:16:15,159 --> 00:16:16,799
promptly investigate the facts,

368
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,639
and urge the relevant departments

369
00:16:21,039 --> 00:16:22,879
to disburse the funds as contracted,

370
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:27,080
ensuring the project moves forward smoothly.

371
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:29,120
Otherwise,

372
00:16:29,639 --> 00:16:32,320
we will take legal action

373
00:16:33,279 --> 00:16:36,200
and expose the truth to the public.

374
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:38,559
Respectfully submitted,

375
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,039
Petitioners:

376
00:16:40,519 --> 00:16:41,519
Sai Duoxi,

377
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,559
Ma Jiucheng

378
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:45,879
November 1, 2008

379
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:49,519
Wait, Mr. Shi...

380
00:16:49,919 --> 00:16:51,159
You had the nerve to report me?

381
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:53,000
You were right there at the scene back then!

382
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:53,759
What happened...

383
00:16:53,759 --> 00:16:54,519
don't you know?

384
00:16:54,799 --> 00:16:56,000
Why I had to leave Honggang...

385
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:56,879
don't you know?

386
00:16:57,279 --> 00:16:58,559
You know damn well what happened!

387
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:25,440
Lao Zhou,

388
00:17:27,039 --> 00:17:27,440
Release the funds.

389
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:28,319
All right.

390
00:17:31,319 --> 00:17:31,759
Wait.

391
00:17:33,839 --> 00:17:34,440
We still need to check.

392
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,079
Xiao Wu.

393
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:57,279
Sister-in-law, what brings you here?

394
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:58,559
Xiao Wu, come here.

395
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,240
I bought you a winter jacket.

396
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:01,000
Come, try it on.

397
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:01,440
Here.

398
00:18:01,759 --> 00:18:02,480
Try it on.

399
00:18:06,359 --> 00:18:06,960
How does it look?

400
00:18:07,559 --> 00:18:07,960
It looks great.

401
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:09,079
I specifically asked your third brother.

402
00:18:09,079 --> 00:18:09,880
He told me

403
00:18:10,039 --> 00:18:11,480
it's the most popular style right now.

404
00:18:11,759 --> 00:18:13,000
Quality stuff really makes a difference.

405
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:15,720
Sister-in-law, isn't this expensive?

406
00:18:16,039 --> 00:18:16,880
Maybe we should return it.

407
00:18:17,039 --> 00:18:17,759
Return it? No way!

408
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:18,519
Absolutely not.

409
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:19,279
Keep it on.

410
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:20,720
You're off to college soon.

411
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:23,200
You'll be living with classmates

412
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:24,319
from all over the country.

413
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:25,599
Without a few decent clothes,

414
00:18:25,599 --> 00:18:26,440
that just won't do.

415
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,079
You never buy anything for yourself.

416
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,559
Why would I?

417
00:18:29,759 --> 00:18:31,519
I'm either at home or in the workshop.

418
00:18:32,279 --> 00:18:33,079
Who would I dress up for?

419
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:34,599
Even if I dressed up,

420
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:36,359
would your eldest brother look at me twice?

421
00:18:37,079 --> 00:18:37,480
Sister-in-law,

422
00:18:38,119 --> 00:18:39,279
just wait until I get into Tsinghua.

423
00:18:39,559 --> 00:18:41,160
Dad will definitely respect you more then.

424
00:18:43,519 --> 00:18:44,680
What does that have to do with me?

425
00:18:45,359 --> 00:18:45,759
It's not like

426
00:18:46,279 --> 00:18:47,480
I ever tutored you.

427
00:18:48,039 --> 00:18:49,079
But you're the one who raised me.

428
00:18:49,559 --> 00:18:50,440
Dad will have to give you credit.

429
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:52,359
It's always my second brother this and that.

430
00:18:52,799 --> 00:18:53,759
Once I get into Tsinghua,

431
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:54,720
let's see who he favors then.

432
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:56,319
Outdo your second brother?

433
00:18:56,839 --> 00:18:57,279
Definitely.

434
00:18:58,599 --> 00:18:59,440
Now hurry off to class.

435
00:19:00,279 --> 00:19:01,359
Go on, get going.

436
00:19:19,279 --> 00:19:19,720
Xiuming!

437
00:19:21,599 --> 00:19:22,039
Xiuming!

438
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:24,279
Uncle Duoxi is here.

439
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:25,559
Who?

440
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:26,680
Uncle Duoxi.

441
00:19:26,839 --> 00:19:27,359
He's in the meeting room.

442
00:19:32,359 --> 00:19:32,920
Qingyou.

443
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:36,880
For small equipment maintenance,

444
00:19:38,279 --> 00:19:40,880
last month was over 3,000.

445
00:19:40,880 --> 00:19:41,200
Right.

446
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:43,480
Why is it 7,800 this month?

447
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:46,200
What did you fix?

448
00:19:46,559 --> 00:19:47,680
The cutting machine broke down.

449
00:19:48,519 --> 00:19:50,200
Then I... Xiuming and I discussed it,

450
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:51,920
and gave it an overhaul.

451
00:19:52,039 --> 00:19:53,359
We replaced several key parts.

452
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:54,759
Dad.

453
00:19:55,279 --> 00:19:55,680
Wait, why...

454
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:57,559
How did you slip out of the hospital?

455
00:19:58,240 --> 00:19:59,200
What do you mean, "slip out"?

456
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:00,480
I mean, you should've told me.

457
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,680
I... I would've picked you up!

458
00:20:02,200 --> 00:20:03,039
It's no big deal.

459
00:20:03,559 --> 00:20:03,880
By the way,

460
00:20:04,119 --> 00:20:05,279
when you get a chance, go to the hospital,

461
00:20:05,279 --> 00:20:06,480
pack up my things,

462
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:07,519
and take them home.

463
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,680
You... you've been discharged?

464
00:20:09,839 --> 00:20:10,359
That's right.

465
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:12,839
Dad, now that you're discharged,

466
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,160
instead of going home to rest,

467
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,640
why did you come to the construction site?

468
00:20:15,720 --> 00:20:16,960
You don't need to worry about this.

469
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:18,079
I'm keeping everything under control.

470
00:20:18,559 --> 00:20:18,880
Right.

471
00:20:19,119 --> 00:20:21,559
I just got back from Shi Yongnian's, too.

472
00:20:22,039 --> 00:20:22,839
With our accounts,

473
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,559
he didn't raise any issues at all.

474
00:20:25,079 --> 00:20:25,599
He said

475
00:20:25,599 --> 00:20:27,160
they'll release our payment right away.

476
00:20:27,559 --> 00:20:27,839
Dad...

477
00:20:28,839 --> 00:20:29,799
They should've released it long ago.

478
00:20:33,759 --> 00:20:34,880
Last Tuesday,

479
00:20:36,559 --> 00:20:37,759
a cash withdrawal

480
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,119
of 300,000.

481
00:20:40,519 --> 00:20:41,240
What was that money for?

482
00:20:45,119 --> 00:20:47,119
Right, that... that was me.

483
00:20:47,119 --> 00:20:47,519
Uncle,

484
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:50,000
Xiuming was...

485
00:20:50,759 --> 00:20:52,559
planning to buy new equipment with it.

486
00:20:53,599 --> 00:20:54,480
But... but then we said no,

487
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:55,680
we decided not to buy it.

488
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,240
Too expensive, not necessary.

489
00:20:57,240 --> 00:20:59,039
Didn't we agree not to buy it?

490
00:20:59,319 --> 00:21:00,200
If you didn't buy it, where's the money?

491
00:21:03,359 --> 00:21:04,759
I just didn't get around to...

492
00:21:04,759 --> 00:21:05,720
didn't get around to depositing it.

493
00:21:06,799 --> 00:21:07,759
Now, I have to call you out on this.

494
00:21:07,759 --> 00:21:08,720
Once cash is withdrawn,

495
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:10,000
it must be deposited back right away!

496
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:11,400
Why didn't you deposit it?

497
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,480
Xiuming, how could you say that?

498
00:21:14,039 --> 00:21:15,559
If you hadn't signed off back then,

499
00:21:15,559 --> 00:21:16,759
could I have withdrawn that money?

500
00:21:17,319 --> 00:21:17,720
Besides,

501
00:21:17,720 --> 00:21:19,160
haven't I been busy checking accounts,

502
00:21:19,160 --> 00:21:20,920
and running to the bank for inspections?

503
00:21:21,400 --> 00:21:21,880
I didn't even have...

504
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:22,440
All right, that's enough!

505
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:23,519
What's the point of making excuses?

506
00:21:23,759 --> 00:21:24,759
Rules and procedures can't be broken.

507
00:21:24,759 --> 00:21:25,920
It's been a week. Hurry up, go, go!

508
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:26,279
Hold on.

509
00:21:26,279 --> 00:21:26,920
Go deposit the money.

510
00:21:27,119 --> 00:21:27,440
Come back here.

511
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:30,400
I asked where the money is right now.

512
00:21:34,759 --> 00:21:35,680
That money is...

513
00:21:36,359 --> 00:21:38,279
It's locked in the accounting office!

514
00:21:40,720 --> 00:21:41,559
Um, Dad...

515
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:42,519
No...

516
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:43,720
Um, Dad...

517
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:45,640
Wait, you...

518
00:21:46,279 --> 00:21:47,599
What else about this money

519
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,000
are you worried about, Dad?

520
00:21:49,559 --> 00:21:50,640
It's all locked up tight.

521
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:51,839
There's really no need...

522
00:21:52,039 --> 00:21:52,599
Open the door.

523
00:21:54,559 --> 00:21:55,240
Open the door!

524
00:22:01,279 --> 00:22:01,839
Uncle...

525
00:22:02,599 --> 00:22:03,960
I'm a disgrace.

526
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:06,839
I failed to look after the money for you.

527
00:22:06,839 --> 00:22:07,480
What happened? Speak!

528
00:22:07,559 --> 00:22:10,079
The third brother took it straight away.

529
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:12,359
The 300,000 hasn't been returned yet.

530
00:22:14,119 --> 00:22:15,519
He insisted on taking it!

531
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,079
Uncle!

532
00:22:21,359 --> 00:22:22,000
Uncle!

533
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:44,920
Well...

534
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:47,279
The third brother isn't back yet.

535
00:22:47,839 --> 00:22:48,559
It's fine, let's not wait.

536
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:50,039
Eldest, start us off.

537
00:22:53,839 --> 00:22:54,640
Dad was discharged from the hospital today,

538
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:56,119
which is a huge joy for our family.

539
00:22:56,400 --> 00:22:58,519
As the saying goes, "Fortune flows like the eastern sea,

540
00:22:58,759 --> 00:23:00,319
and life stands tall as the southern pines."

541
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,160
Dad's recovery this time

542
00:23:02,240 --> 00:23:03,880
is our family's greatest blessing.

543
00:23:04,720 --> 00:23:05,799
And our family's construction team

544
00:23:06,119 --> 00:23:08,519
is our eastern sea and southern pines.

545
00:23:08,720 --> 00:23:09,440
As long as Dad is here,

546
00:23:09,759 --> 00:23:10,559
we will always

547
00:23:10,759 --> 00:23:12,119
keep flowing and standing tall!

548
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:13,240
Come on, let's raise a glass together.

549
00:23:13,519 --> 00:23:15,279
Wishing Dad good health

550
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:16,440
and all the best! Cheers!

551
00:23:16,519 --> 00:23:16,880
Cheers, Dad!

552
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:17,920
To your good health! Good health!

553
00:23:17,920 --> 00:23:18,559
To good health!

554
00:23:28,079 --> 00:23:28,960
Grandpa can't drink.

555
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:29,680
I'll drink for him.

556
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:30,799
All right.

557
00:23:31,279 --> 00:23:32,160
To your health, Dad.

558
00:23:32,359 --> 00:23:32,720
Cheers!

559
00:23:32,799 --> 00:23:33,200
Cheers!

560
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:38,160
It's so sweet.

561
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:43,519
Dad,

562
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:45,240
eat while it's still hot.

563
00:23:45,599 --> 00:23:47,079
The hospital food was so bland.

564
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:49,559
Sister-in-law made this specially for you today.

565
00:23:49,599 --> 00:23:50,519
It's all your favorites.

566
00:23:50,559 --> 00:23:51,519
She spent hours in the kitchen.

567
00:23:52,799 --> 00:23:53,119
Dad,

568
00:23:53,440 --> 00:23:54,799
eat more to build your strength back up.

569
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:57,319
The fish in front of you was made just for you.

570
00:24:04,640 --> 00:24:05,160
Xiao Wu,

571
00:24:05,519 --> 00:24:05,960
Zhenzhu.

572
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:08,640
Grab some food you like

573
00:24:08,839 --> 00:24:09,480
and go eat in your room.

574
00:24:10,119 --> 00:24:11,240
When you're done, get right to your homework.

575
00:24:11,759 --> 00:24:12,680
You don't need to stay here with us.

576
00:24:12,880 --> 00:24:13,240
Go on.

577
00:24:13,720 --> 00:24:14,079
Take some.

578
00:24:14,079 --> 00:24:15,319
Zhenzhu, let's go.

579
00:24:16,279 --> 00:24:16,720
This dish.

580
00:24:17,279 --> 00:24:17,839
Take all of this.

581
00:24:19,359 --> 00:24:20,039
Careful not to drop it.

582
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:25,480
Go on in.

583
00:24:26,359 --> 00:24:26,880
Shut the door.

584
00:24:29,640 --> 00:24:31,680
I've been away for so long.

585
00:24:33,079 --> 00:24:34,079
Is everything okay?

586
00:24:38,119 --> 00:24:39,039
Dad is asking you.

587
00:24:39,519 --> 00:24:40,440
Be upfront with me.

588
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:42,599
We're family.

589
00:24:43,039 --> 00:24:44,880
What can't be put on the table?

590
00:24:47,240 --> 00:24:47,559
Dad,

591
00:24:47,960 --> 00:24:48,480
let me speak first.

592
00:24:48,480 --> 00:24:49,599
Your business can wait.

593
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:50,599
Eldest,

594
00:24:51,279 --> 00:24:53,440
you explain this 300,000 in project funds first.

595
00:24:53,920 --> 00:24:54,759
What is really going on?

596
00:24:59,039 --> 00:24:59,759
Old man, Old man, Old man!

597
00:24:59,799 --> 00:25:00,279
Sorry about that.

598
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:01,680
Got back late.

599
00:25:02,279 --> 00:25:03,079
Had some real business to handle.

600
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:03,440
No, wait—

601
00:25:03,880 --> 00:25:05,359
I know what you're gonna say.

602
00:25:05,519 --> 00:25:06,519
Look, Dad's been waiting for you, and—

603
00:25:06,559 --> 00:25:07,480
What are you doing?

604
00:25:07,720 --> 00:25:08,279
300,000.

605
00:25:08,680 --> 00:25:09,440
Every single cent.

606
00:25:09,759 --> 00:25:10,640
Principal plus interest.

607
00:25:10,799 --> 00:25:11,720
I brought it all back for you.

608
00:25:12,759 --> 00:25:13,519
Plus 20,000 in interest.

609
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:14,559
But that's not for you.

610
00:25:15,680 --> 00:25:16,119
Old man,

611
00:25:17,000 --> 00:25:17,880
this is to celebrate you leaving the hospital,

612
00:25:18,079 --> 00:25:18,799
fully recovered.

613
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:20,359
May you live as long as the southern mountains,

614
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,119
with blessings as vast as the eastern sea,

615
00:25:21,319 --> 00:25:22,279
smiling every day,

616
00:25:22,359 --> 00:25:23,079
and enjoying family happiness forever.

617
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:23,880
This 20,000...

618
00:25:25,319 --> 00:25:26,119
It's from your son, to honor you.

619
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:31,039
Third Brother, aren't you being way too reckless?

620
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:32,000
As they say,

621
00:25:32,319 --> 00:25:33,440
"The bold feast,

622
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:34,480
the timid starve."

623
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:35,960
Old man, let me report to you.

624
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:36,720
Here's what happened.

625
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:37,759
A while back,

626
00:25:37,759 --> 00:25:38,359
while you were in the hospital,

627
00:25:38,559 --> 00:25:39,759
I needed money urgently for business,

628
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:41,200
but no one at home dared make a call.

629
00:25:41,559 --> 00:25:43,160
Eldest Brother wanted team funds for equipment,

630
00:25:43,440 --> 00:25:44,759
so I just jumped in and used it first.

631
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:46,759
This 300,000...

632
00:25:47,119 --> 00:25:47,960
in less than a week,

633
00:25:48,640 --> 00:25:49,599
guess how much I made?

634
00:25:50,279 --> 00:25:50,880
100,000.

635
00:25:52,039 --> 00:25:53,799
Isn't that way more than your construction team?

636
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:56,359
It was a bit of a bumpy ride,

637
00:25:57,039 --> 00:25:57,920
but the money's here,

638
00:25:58,119 --> 00:25:58,559
and that's all that matters.

639
00:25:58,839 --> 00:26:00,039
All that matters, my foot!

640
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,119
With that much money,

641
00:26:02,359 --> 00:26:03,200
if anything had gone wrong,

642
00:26:03,200 --> 00:26:05,000
could you... could you handle the consequences?

643
00:26:05,079 --> 00:26:05,759
Consequences?

644
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:08,240
The consequence is I turned 300,000 into 100,000 profit!

645
00:26:08,640 --> 00:26:09,279
If I gave you this 300,000

646
00:26:09,279 --> 00:26:10,240
to buy new equipment,

647
00:26:10,240 --> 00:26:11,079
you'd lose half of it.

648
00:26:11,079 --> 00:26:11,559
Believe me!

649
00:26:11,559 --> 00:26:12,759
What can you even do?

650
00:26:12,759 --> 00:26:13,319
I buy equipment

651
00:26:13,319 --> 00:26:14,839
for our family's long-term future!

652
00:26:15,039 --> 00:26:17,039
What you're doing is sheer opportunism!

653
00:26:17,039 --> 00:26:17,799
Stop lecturing me!

654
00:26:17,799 --> 00:26:18,160
Let me tell you,

655
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,039
you're just a good-for-nothing!

656
00:26:19,039 --> 00:26:19,680
With family matters—

657
00:26:19,680 --> 00:26:21,160
Who are you calling a good-for-nothing?

658
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:22,160
Both of you, cut it out!

659
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:22,920
You pipe down too!

660
00:26:23,400 --> 00:26:24,279
Second Brother, I haven't even started on you!

661
00:26:24,279 --> 00:26:25,279
Trying to wash your hands clean?

662
00:26:28,440 --> 00:26:30,279
If you... if you put some effort

663
00:26:30,279 --> 00:26:31,559
into managing our family accounts,

664
00:26:31,559 --> 00:26:32,000
into this,

665
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:34,160
could something this huge have happened?

666
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:35,480
Xiuhe, Eldest Brother,

667
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:36,680
Dad just got out of the hospital.

668
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:37,559
For today,

669
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:38,519
let's drop this,

670
00:26:38,519 --> 00:26:38,960
all right?

671
00:26:39,480 --> 00:26:41,160
Besides, Xiuliang meant well.

672
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:43,720
Old man, hear me out.

673
00:26:43,799 --> 00:26:45,599
Times have changed now.

674
00:26:46,079 --> 00:26:46,440
Look,

675
00:26:47,079 --> 00:26:47,839
with 300,000,

676
00:26:47,920 --> 00:26:49,440
I made 100,000 in less than a week.

677
00:26:49,799 --> 00:26:50,799
That's 30 percent!

678
00:26:51,039 --> 00:26:52,599
Give me that 14 million demolition payout,

679
00:26:52,599 --> 00:26:53,200
and guess how much I could make?

680
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:53,599
Enough!

681
00:26:53,599 --> 00:26:54,160
Five million!

682
00:26:56,119 --> 00:26:57,119
Your eldest brother is right.

683
00:26:57,720 --> 00:26:58,519
This 300,000

684
00:26:58,720 --> 00:27:01,759
is lifeline money for wages and materials,

685
00:27:02,000 --> 00:27:03,759
not your personal gambling stake.

686
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:05,799
Did you ever consider,

687
00:27:06,839 --> 00:27:08,240
if you lost everything

688
00:27:09,039 --> 00:27:09,799
and the money was gone,

689
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:11,880
what were you gonna do?

690
00:27:12,119 --> 00:27:14,119
Shut down my construction site all over again?

691
00:27:15,319 --> 00:27:16,799
I wouldn't lose!

692
00:27:23,799 --> 00:27:25,559
It's not that I don't want to let go.

693
00:27:26,279 --> 00:27:27,519
I handed the ledger to you,

694
00:27:28,359 --> 00:27:29,200
but did you keep it safe?

695
00:27:29,960 --> 00:27:30,920
You let someone swindle it away!

696
00:27:33,039 --> 00:27:33,960
You took the ledger,

697
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:34,519
and what did you do?

698
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:36,759
Reckless nonsense!

699
00:27:37,160 --> 00:27:38,839
You let two thieves under our own roof take advantage!

700
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:41,039
How can I trust you two brothers

701
00:27:41,039 --> 00:27:42,640
to run this family properly?

702
00:27:45,839 --> 00:27:46,920
Talking about family now, are you?

703
00:27:48,279 --> 00:27:49,720
You've washed your hands of this family,

704
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:50,119
haven't you?

705
00:27:50,680 --> 00:27:52,400
Now you're pitting the two brothers against each other,

706
00:27:52,920 --> 00:27:54,920
caring only about your business on the side,

707
00:27:55,039 --> 00:27:55,400
aren't you?

708
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:57,799
And you even used my daughter as a shield!

709
00:27:59,519 --> 00:28:01,160
Burning the candle at both ends...

710
00:28:02,519 --> 00:28:03,720
Don't run yourself into the ground.

711
00:28:04,960 --> 00:28:05,400
Dad,

712
00:28:08,039 --> 00:28:09,200
if I hadn't come back,

713
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:11,240
you would've torn this house apart!

714
00:28:18,079 --> 00:28:20,000
Welcome to tonight's Economic Perspectives.

715
00:28:20,319 --> 00:28:21,440
I'm your host, Yang Meifan.

716
00:28:21,759 --> 00:28:23,440
Tonight, we focus on the domestic economy.

717
00:28:36,079 --> 00:28:36,400
Second Brother!

718
00:28:36,799 --> 00:28:37,759
Second Brother, where are you going?

719
00:28:37,759 --> 00:28:38,480
Shut up.

720
00:28:41,799 --> 00:28:43,680
...reflects shared concerns and reflections.

721
00:28:45,519 --> 00:28:46,559
The core question is:

722
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:48,519
with such massive capital investment,

723
00:28:48,759 --> 00:28:50,200
how will it be channeled precisely

724
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:52,079
into the real economy and public welfare,

725
00:28:52,599 --> 00:28:54,680
and how to effectively prevent asset bubbles?

726
00:28:55,440 --> 00:28:58,359
Dad, in that report, what happened 18 years ago?

727
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,079
What was it really about?

728
00:29:00,559 --> 00:29:02,599
What grudge do you have against Shi Yongnian?

729
00:29:05,079 --> 00:29:06,920
That's ancient history.

730
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:08,039
Why bring it up now?

731
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:11,599
What do you want from me?

732
00:29:13,799 --> 00:29:14,519
I really didn't expect

733
00:29:15,359 --> 00:29:16,559
you'd have a trick like this up your sleeve.

734
00:29:18,200 --> 00:29:20,160
Writing a report to Tengyue headquarters?

735
00:29:20,759 --> 00:29:21,799
Dad, you're not the kind of person

736
00:29:21,799 --> 00:29:23,759
who acts without thinking of the consequences.

737
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:24,880
Haven't you thought about it?

738
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:27,160
If he's truly stuck at headquarters and can't return,

739
00:29:27,160 --> 00:29:27,799
fine.

740
00:29:28,119 --> 00:29:29,240
But what if he comes back?

741
00:29:29,640 --> 00:29:30,279
Then this score—

742
00:29:30,279 --> 00:29:31,880
he'll settle it sooner or later!

743
00:29:32,279 --> 00:29:33,759
And if I hadn't done this,

744
00:29:34,279 --> 00:29:36,200
just relying on you to stand before Shi Yongnian,

745
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:38,160
sweet-talking and reasoning with him,

746
00:29:38,759 --> 00:29:39,240
could that win?

747
00:29:39,599 --> 00:29:40,880
Would he spare the construction team?

748
00:29:41,359 --> 00:29:42,839
Would he spare our family?

749
00:29:42,920 --> 00:29:43,480
No, Dad, you...

750
00:29:43,640 --> 00:29:44,759
Have you thought about me at all?

751
00:29:44,759 --> 00:29:45,880
Do you trust me?

752
00:29:46,279 --> 00:29:47,599
While I'm pouring my heart and soul

753
00:29:47,599 --> 00:29:48,640
into dealing with Tengyue,

754
00:29:48,759 --> 00:29:49,880
and cleaning up the mess when I get back,

755
00:29:50,079 --> 00:29:51,000
before you did this,

756
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:52,559
couldn't you have discussed it with me?

757
00:29:52,720 --> 00:29:55,200
Tengyue is my biggest partner right now.

758
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:56,480
How am I supposed to face them?

759
00:29:56,519 --> 00:29:57,440
Have you thought about me at all?

760
00:29:57,440 --> 00:29:58,759
Have you thought about this family?

761
00:30:00,079 --> 00:30:01,160
Don't think I don't know

762
00:30:01,160 --> 00:30:02,839
what you told your eldest brother and sister-in-law!

763
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:05,000
You want to disband this construction team,

764
00:30:05,279 --> 00:30:05,720
don't you?

765
00:30:06,839 --> 00:30:07,599
Second Brother,

766
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:09,519
I just want to ask you:

767
00:30:10,119 --> 00:30:11,440
in your heart,

768
00:30:12,079 --> 00:30:14,720
do the livelihoods of dozens on the team

769
00:30:15,759 --> 00:30:16,400
even matter?

770
00:30:17,200 --> 00:30:18,359
In your eyes,

771
00:30:19,079 --> 00:30:20,759
between me and Shi Yongnian,

772
00:30:21,400 --> 00:30:22,160
who matters more?

773
00:30:26,440 --> 00:30:29,440
You keep claiming I don't trust you.

774
00:30:29,759 --> 00:30:31,720
But when have you ever trusted me?

775
00:30:31,799 --> 00:30:33,079
Dad, you know very well

776
00:30:33,079 --> 00:30:35,000
how much risk I took doing this!

777
00:30:35,079 --> 00:30:37,160
Wasn't it all just to keep this family afloat?

778
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:39,200
I've already done everything I can,

779
00:30:39,319 --> 00:30:39,599
and you...

780
00:30:40,799 --> 00:30:41,880
So can you tell me,

781
00:30:42,079 --> 00:30:43,319
what exactly am I supposed to do

782
00:30:43,440 --> 00:30:45,359
for it to truly be for this family's sake?

783
00:30:59,559 --> 00:31:00,680
About this matter,

784
00:31:01,119 --> 00:31:02,519
I really have to thank you

785
00:31:03,440 --> 00:31:04,480
for helping the construction team

786
00:31:04,759 --> 00:31:05,759
and helping this family

787
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:08,279
get through the hardest hurdle.

788
00:31:08,839 --> 00:31:09,400
Don't worry.

789
00:31:10,319 --> 00:31:11,319
I promised you,

790
00:31:13,599 --> 00:31:14,599
so as for this family,

791
00:31:15,799 --> 00:31:16,839
you don't need to worry anymore.

792
00:31:17,319 --> 00:31:18,359
I keep my word.

793
00:31:19,079 --> 00:31:20,039
From now on,

794
00:31:20,359 --> 00:31:21,720
we'll go our separate ways.

795
00:31:23,160 --> 00:31:23,519
By the way,

796
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:26,000
registering the new company requires qualifications.

797
00:31:26,000 --> 00:31:26,880
Help get that done.

798
00:31:27,440 --> 00:31:28,319
Once that's done,

799
00:31:29,440 --> 00:31:30,680
you and this family

800
00:31:31,279 --> 00:31:32,160
will be completely even.

801
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:48,799
For the new company

802
00:31:49,559 --> 00:31:50,440
to apply for qualifications,

803
00:31:51,119 --> 00:31:52,480
we still need to inject capital, and

804
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:54,759
we'll need your ID and bankbook.

805
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:23,359
Sister-in-law,

806
00:32:24,079 --> 00:32:24,759
I'm so sorry.

807
00:32:24,960 --> 00:32:26,039
I couldn't hold out

808
00:32:26,039 --> 00:32:26,799
and spilled everything to Dad.

809
00:32:27,519 --> 00:32:28,880
But Dad isn't really blaming you.

810
00:32:29,160 --> 00:32:30,480
It's all Sai Xiuhe's fault.

811
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:31,960
It was clearly his mistake,

812
00:32:31,960 --> 00:32:33,079
yet you took the heat for it.

813
00:32:34,079 --> 00:32:35,119
I'm used to it by now.

814
00:32:36,079 --> 00:32:37,039
In this family,

815
00:32:37,160 --> 00:32:38,519
I'm the only outsider.

816
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:40,200
Whenever anything goes wrong,

817
00:32:40,319 --> 00:32:42,839
big or small, looking for a traitor,

818
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:44,559
the first person Dad suspects

819
00:32:44,559 --> 00:32:45,400
is always me.

820
00:32:45,880 --> 00:32:46,960
As for the wedding dress business,

821
00:32:47,200 --> 00:32:48,200
Dad was bound to find out sooner or later.

822
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:49,599
It's no big deal.

823
00:32:51,079 --> 00:32:51,720
That's a relief.

824
00:32:53,599 --> 00:32:55,599
When is that foreign client coming?

825
00:32:56,519 --> 00:32:57,359
They said soon,

826
00:32:57,799 --> 00:32:58,680
but haven't set a date.

827
00:32:59,160 --> 00:33:00,319
We have to seize the chance this time

828
00:33:00,319 --> 00:33:01,119
to get in touch with him.

829
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:03,039
Let him know that our wedding dresses,

830
00:33:03,160 --> 00:33:04,319
compared to what Brother Peng offers,

831
00:33:04,599 --> 00:33:06,359
have better craftsmanship and lower prices.

832
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:06,880
Don't worry.

833
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:08,599
I've got a plan.

834
00:33:10,319 --> 00:33:11,079
That's great!

835
00:33:32,519 --> 00:33:32,880
Sister-in-law.

836
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:33,759
Let me do that.

837
00:33:34,039 --> 00:33:34,880
No, don't. It's dirty.

838
00:33:34,880 --> 00:33:35,559
It's no trouble.

839
00:33:40,599 --> 00:33:42,000
What's my brother been up to lately?

840
00:33:42,920 --> 00:33:44,319
Just the usual construction site stuff.

841
00:33:44,799 --> 00:33:45,759
Ever since Dad went to the hospital,

842
00:33:45,759 --> 00:33:46,640
he hasn't had a moment's rest.

843
00:33:48,079 --> 00:33:49,680
But all that work hasn't amounted to anything.

844
00:33:51,319 --> 00:33:52,279
Sister-in-law, sometimes you should...

845
00:33:53,279 --> 00:33:54,599
show my brother a bit more care.

846
00:33:55,839 --> 00:33:57,319
How else am I supposed to care for him?

847
00:33:57,920 --> 00:33:59,160
Three meals a day, his daily routine—

848
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:00,720
what don't I look after?

849
00:34:01,279 --> 00:34:02,200
That's not what I mean.

850
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:04,160
I don't mean daily chores.

851
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:05,799
I'm talking about...

852
00:34:06,960 --> 00:34:08,320
emotionally and mentally.

853
00:34:08,320 --> 00:34:09,159
Show him a bit more support.

854
00:34:09,679 --> 00:34:10,119
You know,

855
00:34:10,599 --> 00:34:11,679
men as a species...

856
00:34:11,679 --> 00:34:12,280
they... they...

857
00:34:12,960 --> 00:34:14,199
they just...

858
00:34:14,199 --> 00:34:16,639
confidence and pride are equally important.

859
00:34:17,199 --> 00:34:18,320
When he's out dealing with things,

860
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:19,360
whatever it is, you could...

861
00:34:20,119 --> 00:34:20,920
criticize him a little less.

862
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:21,719
Save him some face.

863
00:34:22,519 --> 00:34:23,760
Just give him a little more of that...

864
00:34:24,079 --> 00:34:25,360
that emotional care and support.

865
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:28,320
Your brother is well into his forties.

866
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:29,320
He's not a three-year-old kid.

867
00:34:29,320 --> 00:34:30,960
Am I supposed to coddle and pamper him all day?

868
00:34:31,280 --> 00:34:33,119
Dad just complained at dinner that I ignore the home,

869
00:34:33,280 --> 00:34:34,079
and now you're complaining

870
00:34:34,920 --> 00:34:36,360
that I don't give him enough care.

871
00:34:37,239 --> 00:34:38,119
You people in the Sai family,

872
00:34:38,719 --> 00:34:40,159
you're all impossible to please.

873
00:34:40,920 --> 00:34:41,400
Go on back.

874
00:34:51,199 --> 00:34:52,000
What are you doing?

875
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:55,039
Didn't you say last time your bed was too hard?

876
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:57,400
I found a thick blanket in the closet

877
00:34:57,480 --> 00:34:58,360
and laid it underneath as padding.

878
00:34:58,639 --> 00:34:59,599
That should make it more comfortable.

879
00:34:59,840 --> 00:35:01,079
Hard or not,

880
00:35:03,280 --> 00:35:05,000
I've slept on it since childhood.

881
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,320
I spoke with Jiaqi's mother

882
00:35:06,840 --> 00:35:07,800
on the phone already.

883
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:09,639
We've made a deal.

884
00:35:09,719 --> 00:35:11,119
Once I save up enough child support,

885
00:35:11,199 --> 00:35:12,719
I'll send Jiaqi back to the States.

886
00:35:13,199 --> 00:35:14,440
The two of us can go back to how it was,

887
00:35:14,559 --> 00:35:15,159
just the two of us,

888
00:35:15,599 --> 00:35:16,400
living a good life together.

889
00:35:25,880 --> 00:35:26,400
What's the matter?

890
00:35:28,199 --> 00:35:28,760
It'll get better.

891
00:35:29,679 --> 00:35:30,239
It'll all work out.

892
00:35:41,079 --> 00:35:41,679
Um...

893
00:35:43,039 --> 00:35:43,480
what's her name...

894
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:44,760
Zhao Jiaqi.

895
00:35:46,039 --> 00:35:47,199
How has she been lately?

896
00:35:50,119 --> 00:35:50,599
Her?

897
00:35:51,639 --> 00:35:52,360
She's doing well.

898
00:35:54,119 --> 00:35:54,960
I don't know why,

899
00:35:55,679 --> 00:35:57,079
but she's fallen in love with Chinese food lately.

900
00:35:58,199 --> 00:35:58,519
Oh, right.

901
00:35:59,079 --> 00:35:59,760
She also mentioned

902
00:36:00,920 --> 00:36:01,760
that when you came back last time

903
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:03,519
and helped her with those English materials,

904
00:36:04,159 --> 00:36:05,440
she said your writing was really good.

905
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:07,360
She said because of you,

906
00:36:08,360 --> 00:36:09,199
she's fallen in love with Chinese.

907
00:36:11,599 --> 00:36:14,400
My grades in school weren't that great,

908
00:36:14,559 --> 00:36:16,800
but my Chinese was always pretty good.

909
00:36:20,639 --> 00:36:22,000
Take a few books back with you

910
00:36:22,079 --> 00:36:22,880
and let her read them.

911
00:36:25,519 --> 00:36:26,960
When learning Chinese,

912
00:36:27,559 --> 00:36:29,960
you can't just guess your way through.

913
00:36:31,159 --> 00:36:32,079
Reading these more often

914
00:36:32,280 --> 00:36:32,880
will do her good.

915
00:36:35,039 --> 00:36:36,159
Thinking about it now,

916
00:36:36,559 --> 00:36:37,760
she's pretty pitiful too.

917
00:36:39,519 --> 00:36:40,920
It's clearly the adults' fault.

918
00:36:41,719 --> 00:36:43,599
There's no need to make the kid suffer for it.

919
00:36:44,639 --> 00:36:45,760
It's not her fault, after all.

920
00:36:51,639 --> 00:36:52,000
That's true.

921
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:53,400
Don't worry.

922
00:36:54,719 --> 00:36:55,679
I'll handle it properly.

923
00:36:58,079 --> 00:36:58,920
Jin Jingran,

924
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:01,360
do you love me?

925
00:37:01,719 --> 00:37:02,519
Of course I do.

926
00:37:03,119 --> 00:37:04,400
Who else would I love if not you?

927
00:37:04,800 --> 00:37:06,840
I'd give you the best of everything in the world if I could.

928
00:37:10,079 --> 00:37:10,840
Then what if one day...

929
00:37:11,519 --> 00:37:12,360
would you ever cheat on me?

930
00:37:13,119 --> 00:37:14,320
How could I ever cheat?

931
00:37:14,599 --> 00:37:15,639
I'd never cheat on you.

932
00:37:16,719 --> 00:37:18,719
Forget it. There's no point in asking.

933
00:37:19,039 --> 00:37:19,760
No matter how deep the love,

934
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:21,920
people still cheat when the time comes.

935
00:37:22,079 --> 00:37:22,480
No, no, no.

936
00:37:22,840 --> 00:37:23,519
I swear.

937
00:37:24,239 --> 00:37:25,599
In this lifetime, I, Jin Jingran,

938
00:37:25,599 --> 00:37:26,960
will only ever love Sai Qianjin.

939
00:37:26,960 --> 00:37:27,880
Come on, I could never cheat.

940
00:37:28,719 --> 00:37:29,920
I will go back with you,

941
00:37:30,199 --> 00:37:31,119
just not right now.

942
00:37:31,679 --> 00:37:32,519
Sister-in-law

943
00:37:33,119 --> 00:37:34,360
really needs me right now.

944
00:37:35,360 --> 00:37:36,079
What happened to her?

945
00:37:38,000 --> 00:37:38,599
Nothing.

946
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:40,920
Whatever. Men's words can never be trusted anyway.

947
00:37:41,360 --> 00:37:42,119
Other men are other men.

948
00:37:43,079 --> 00:37:43,599
I'm me.

949
00:37:44,119 --> 00:37:45,239
I would never, ever cheat.

950
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:31,039
About that side gig you mentioned,

951
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:33,440
I'll take it.

952
00:38:35,360 --> 00:38:36,360
Try to negotiate the pay a bit more.

953
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:38,679
The higher, the better.

954
00:38:45,320 --> 00:38:46,519
It's just so frustrating.

955
00:38:47,679 --> 00:38:48,960
Dad thinks I'm good for nothing

956
00:38:49,320 --> 00:38:50,119
and just make reckless calls.

957
00:38:50,599 --> 00:38:52,079
Second Brother thinks I achieve nothing

958
00:38:52,079 --> 00:38:53,079
and can't make up my mind.

959
00:38:53,519 --> 00:38:54,400
Third Brother took a beating,

960
00:38:54,880 --> 00:38:56,280
but he brought home the money.

961
00:38:56,559 --> 00:38:57,679
Dad actually respects him for that.

962
00:38:58,119 --> 00:39:00,599
Now even Fourth Brother is starting a business with you.

963
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:01,800
Tell me, what can I do?

964
00:39:02,079 --> 00:39:03,480
Turns out I'm just a piece of furniture at home.

965
00:39:03,559 --> 00:39:04,960
Aside from getting blamed by you,

966
00:39:05,119 --> 00:39:05,880
I can't accomplish anything.

967
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:07,239
If you know where the problem lies,

968
00:39:07,239 --> 00:39:08,239
then fix it!

969
00:39:08,559 --> 00:39:09,199
What's the point of just grumbling

970
00:39:09,199 --> 00:39:09,880
in here?

971
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:11,599
Dad only cares about results.

972
00:39:11,920 --> 00:39:13,519
He won't listen to you whining about your grievances.

973
00:39:13,760 --> 00:39:15,800
All you do is mope and sigh in this room every day.

974
00:39:16,119 --> 00:39:17,079
What does that solve?

975
00:39:17,320 --> 00:39:18,440
Alright, fine.

976
00:39:22,519 --> 00:39:23,280
I know.

977
00:39:23,639 --> 00:39:24,079
Actually...

978
00:39:24,599 --> 00:39:25,639
it hasn't been easy for you either.

979
00:39:29,639 --> 00:39:30,280
You,

980
00:39:31,559 --> 00:39:32,599
you just care too much about saving face.

981
00:39:32,880 --> 00:39:34,760
You take your status as the eldest brother too seriously,

982
00:39:35,039 --> 00:39:35,800
carrying too heavy a burden.

983
00:39:36,039 --> 00:39:37,119
That's why you can't swallow your pride

984
00:39:37,480 --> 00:39:38,159
or take real risks.

985
00:39:38,679 --> 00:39:40,199
You're not as slick as Second Brother,

986
00:39:40,679 --> 00:39:42,480
nor as daring as Third Brother.

987
00:39:43,199 --> 00:39:43,880
But I know

988
00:39:44,679 --> 00:39:45,599
everything you do

989
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:47,719
is for the two of us,

990
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:49,559
to make us proud.

991
00:39:49,840 --> 00:39:51,239
You've never thought about yourself.

992
00:39:51,679 --> 00:39:52,360
For that alone,

993
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:53,559
you're a hundred times better than them.

994
00:39:56,519 --> 00:39:57,360
Come on.

995
00:39:58,719 --> 00:39:59,719
Whenever something comes up from now on,

996
00:40:00,960 --> 00:40:02,199
we'll talk it through together.

997
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:05,400
No matter how chaotic things get out there,

998
00:40:05,679 --> 00:40:06,199
once the door is closed,

999
00:40:06,199 --> 00:40:07,800
we're always united as one.

1000
00:40:08,280 --> 00:40:08,719
Right?

1001
00:40:14,800 --> 00:40:15,840
I'll go get some foot-soaking water for you.

1002
00:40:36,199 --> 00:40:36,920
A daughter,

1003
00:40:38,000 --> 00:40:38,679
a wife,

1004
00:40:39,639 --> 00:40:40,440
and a home.

1005
00:40:42,079 --> 00:40:43,639
As foolish as Sai Xiuming was,

1006
00:40:44,679 --> 00:40:47,280
he knew it was time to wake from his delusions.

1007
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:51,679
The happiness right before him was what was real.

1008
00:42:26,000 --> 00:42:26,519
Who are you?

1009
00:42:29,559 --> 00:42:30,320
What are you doing in my house?

1010
00:42:31,679 --> 00:42:32,280
No, I... Wait...

1011
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:32,840
What are you doing?

1012
00:42:32,840 --> 00:42:33,920
Wait, listen to me!

1013
00:42:34,039 --> 00:42:34,480
I... I...

1014
00:42:34,480 --> 00:42:35,400
Who let you into our house?

1015
00:42:35,400 --> 00:42:35,920
No, no!

1016
00:42:35,960 --> 00:42:36,960
Are you stealing from us?

1017
00:42:37,360 --> 00:42:37,639
Wait!

1018
00:42:38,480 --> 00:42:39,280
I'm not, I'm not!

1019
00:42:39,280 --> 00:42:39,960
Are you a thief?

1020
00:42:39,960 --> 00:42:40,760
Listen to me!

1021
00:42:41,079 --> 00:42:42,400
Just... listen to me!

1022
00:42:43,159 --> 00:42:43,840
You're stealing from my family!

1023
00:42:43,840 --> 00:42:44,159
No!

1024
00:42:45,480 --> 00:42:46,119
Don't run!

1025
00:42:46,920 --> 00:42:47,440
Stop right there!

1026
00:42:47,440 --> 00:42:48,440
Just hear me out!

1027
00:42:49,679 --> 00:42:50,280
Trying to run?

1028
00:42:50,440 --> 00:42:51,760
You think you can run?!

1029
00:42:52,760 --> 00:42:53,199
Who are you?!

1030
00:42:53,360 --> 00:42:54,280
I'm not a thief!

1031
00:42:54,280 --> 00:42:55,320
I'm really not a thief!

1032
00:42:55,320 --> 00:42:56,280
I'm calling the police!

1033
00:42:56,440 --> 00:42:57,199
Don't, Wen Jiayin!

1034
00:42:57,199 --> 00:42:57,639
Breaking into our home to steal...

1035
00:42:58,639 --> 00:42:59,440
Don't call the cops!

1036
00:42:59,559 --> 00:43:00,559
I'm not a thief!

1037
00:43:01,400 --> 00:43:02,239
How do you know my name?

1038
00:43:02,719 --> 00:43:03,159
Never mind that!

1039
00:43:03,159 --> 00:43:03,880
I'm not a thief!

1040
00:43:04,280 --> 00:43:04,599
Get up!

1041
00:43:04,599 --> 00:43:05,079
Then who are you?

1042
00:43:05,480 --> 00:43:06,199
Who on earth are you?

1043
00:43:06,199 --> 00:43:06,719
Say something!

1044
00:43:06,719 --> 00:43:07,760
I'm Xiao Wu's birth mother.

1045
00:43:08,079 --> 00:43:09,280
Sai Xiuli's birth mother.

1046
00:43:20,320 --> 00:43:21,920
We're becoming in-laws, right?

1047
00:43:23,639 --> 00:43:24,039
Third Brother.

1048
00:43:24,400 --> 00:43:24,920
Stop talking.

1049
00:43:24,920 --> 00:43:26,000
What does this have to do with you?

1050
00:43:26,440 --> 00:43:27,599
Let me report something to you.

1051
00:43:27,719 --> 00:43:29,280
Your fine son Sai Xiuhe,

1052
00:43:29,280 --> 00:43:31,480
today on his grand opening day,

1053
00:43:31,639 --> 00:43:32,199
in front of everyone,

1054
00:43:32,599 --> 00:43:35,000
held my aunt Hao Zhihua's hand,

1055
00:43:35,480 --> 00:43:36,679
and they went public.

1056
00:43:37,119 --> 00:43:38,519
Back then in Qingyangli,

1057
00:43:39,079 --> 00:43:39,960
out of so many families,

1058
00:43:39,960 --> 00:43:41,079
I specifically chose yours.

1059
00:43:41,159 --> 00:43:42,079
Look how well he was raised.

1060
00:43:42,079 --> 00:43:43,119
Do you want to see Xiuli?

1061
00:43:43,360 --> 00:43:43,920
What did you say?

1062
00:43:44,679 --> 00:43:45,360
I'm asking you a question.

1063
00:43:45,360 --> 00:43:46,719
Do you want to see Xiuli every single day?
